cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project or its findings, please cite it as below."
title: "COLD READ: The Anonymity Half-Life of Written Text"
authors:
  - family-names: "Syed"
    given-names: "Zaid Ali"
date-released: 2026-08-23
url: "https://github.com/zaidwhy/coldread"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zaidwhy/coldread"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Measures how many words a person must write before a language model
  can infer who they are. Finds that the anonymity half-life is a
  property of the reader model, not the text - one model needs 800
  words to infer gender, another needs 50, on the same text.
